  "body": "If I'm reading the spec correctly, currently the spec allows both no-cors and navigate requests to cross-origin blob URLs. I don't think that is actually what implementations do. I haven't done exhaustive testing, but at least chrome and firefox both seem to block cross origin navigate requests to blob URLs and at least some no-cors requests.\r\n\r\nSo am I missing something in the spec, or is the spec actually more permissive than what implementations do?",
